RACK_update_reo_wnd():
/* DSACKベースの並べ替えウィンドウの適応 */ If RACK.dsack_round is not None AND SND.UNA >= RACK.dsack_round: RACK.dsack_round = None /* DSACKを受信した往復ごとに並べ替えウィンドウを大きくする。 DSACKのない回復が16回続いたらウィンドウをリセットする */ If RACK.dsack_round is None AND any DSACK option is present on latest received ACK: RACK.dsack_round = SND.NXT RACK.reo_wnd_mult += 1 RACK.reo_wnd_persist = 16 Else if exiting Fast or RTO recovery: RACK.reo_wnd_persist -= 1 If RACK.reo_wnd_persist <= 0: RACK.reo_wnd_mult = 1
If RACK.reordering_seen is FALSE: If in Fast or RTO recovery: Return 0 Else if RACK.segs_sacked >= DupThresh: Return 0 Return min(RACK.reo_wnd_mult * RACK.min_RTT / 4, SRTT)
